<view class="page"><scene-backdrop/><view class="eyebrow">BETTER TOGETHER</view><view class="title">好球，和好友一起</view><view class="sub">通过邀请或扫码加入同组的微信用户，会出现在这里。</view><button wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="primary space" bindtap="login">微信登录</button><button class="space" bindtap="groups">邀请好友 / 扫码入组</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note space">{{error}}</view><view class="section">我的球友 · {{friends.length}}</view><view class="card row" wx:for="{{friends}}" wx:key="id"><view class="avatar">{{item.name[0]}}</view><view class="grow"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">微信已登录球友</view></view><text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">移除</text></view><view wx:if="{{!friends.length}}" class="empty">邀请一位微信好友加入小组，开启下一场。</view></view><privacy-panel/>
